    <Feat>
      <Name>Wild Shape: Blighted Wolf</Name>
      <Description>Animal Form: Transform into a Blighted Wolf. While in this form, you gain a +20%
Combat Style bonus to attack speed, a 15% bonus to movement speed, and a 10%
Profane bonus to Max Hit Points. You suffer a -2 penalty to Intelligence and
Charisma and take 15% more damage from fire. While in Blighted Wolf form you
gain access to a number of spells and enhancements that require Wold form, but
the cooldowns of your non-animal form spells are increased to 2.5 times their
normal length.

You now attack with tooth and claw using the stats of whatever weapon held in
your right hand. Shields work normally but you cannot shield bash.

Filled with blight you are considered a plant, gaining 100% Fortification,
immunity to stun, mind effects and drowning. If you are a Warforged, you are no
longer considered a Living Construct, and can now be healed normally by Positive
energy spells, and you become immune to repair spells.

You cannot use wands or scrolls while in animal form.</Description>
